{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":61919,\"title\":\"Yatterman Night\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A girl is looking at a remote island on the ocean named The Yatter Kingdom, a country that is said to be ruled by the hero Yatterman. The girl wants to ask the Yattermans for some help to cure her sick mother and decides to venture to the kingdom. She gets kicked out from the kingdom though and her mother dies without receiving any help.\\n\\nUnder Dokurobei, the boss of the Dorombo thieves that existed, lies a beauty named Doronjo. The two men, Boyacky and Tonzura, worked under Doronjo but got kicked out from the Yatter Kingdom along with the Doronbo thieves as they lost a fight against the Yatterman. This is the new generation of Dorombo—Doronjo, Boyacky, Tonzura, and new Yatterman—a story of the birth of Gan-chan and Ai-chan.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1WlcVJeidNe2d3EL6fQHetM3BQK.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3mDaQnAelcx1gncES2FeRQ0O6SB.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":12,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"TOKYO MX\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-03-29\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1286723,\"name\":\"Tatsuya Yoshihara\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8vCTM5LoMueuEEWat9qlx0EXg8p.jpg\"},{\"id\":1847521,\"name\":\"Ryota Itoh\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1627356,\"name\":\"Yoshinobu Tokumoto\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1780650,\"name\":\"Tatsuya Nokimori\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2805656,\"name\":\"Masahiko Matsuyama\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1493759,\"name\":\"Hideaki Nakano\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1148287,\"name\":\"Shin'ichi Masaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":225999,\"name\":\"Eri Kitamura\",\"character\":\"Leopard (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oZuKOoiqUsZZcgO5wqlUoZQUPfw.jpg\"},{\"id\":571993,\"name\":\"Shizuka Itoh\",\"character\":\"Alouette (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n47YvFPlJzl8HnsoDBtM8SUqG8q.jpg\"},{\"id\":84505,\"name\":\"Hiroaki Hirata\",\"character\":\"Voltkatze (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mMWEdlssJm3TVuXW4Wb7pQeX20Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":225603,\"name\":\"Kenta Miyake\",\"character\":\"Elephantus (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7YL8vM2KYzPMeQqTpHWmNj6s1AP.jpg\"},{\"id\":225996,\"name\":\"Hiroyuki Yoshino\",\"character\":\"Galina (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZQbjjvAjPpjGYenY7kLDtW9e7N.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"kMp0vu2yUiQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YWz1g9XKqfw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"P1J7WsnST10\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":97243,\"title\":\"Kamisama Minarai: Himitsu no Cocotama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/alZBH9XDflTctNO5GIRkGmx5Zqw.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43000000000000005,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31715,\"title\":\"Strain: Strategic Armored Infantry\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WrCZULqB481U27oqAOtTLn5dqj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4276595744680851,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":130753,\"title\":\"Zodiac Warriors\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rvHO9RGPCbKL2h1miL3Pu2JKP0J.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41926605504587156,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":314554,\"title\":\"From Overshadowed to Overpowered: Second Reincarnation of a Talentless Sage\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p4TE3kK2iyuADfDYIRDTxjahdNa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4137614678899083,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31718,\"title\":\"Darker than Black\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPvVMKMsQGCV6dlLAtCKT9CsSWN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41363636363636364,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31739,\"title\":\"Kiba\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/roNaULLgqVA8SnLoOntOaPFvY8L.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4126506024096386,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31910,\"title\":\"Naruto Shippūden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kV27j3Nz4d5z8u6mN3EJw9RiLg2.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4094736842105263,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31724,\"title\":\"Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cFqtyKUbdo1IurdpkK4tDthUJO.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40937500000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":31731,\"title\":\"Gunslinger Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hZrhtwcSydWh3rxQSB6we1KSql7.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21962616822429906,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":314561,\"title\":\"Perfect Addiction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvqBzg1YHek499OQP2k6MWWI23X.jpg\",\"rating\":4.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21500000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31736,\"title\":\"Eyeshield 21\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1y4hiISidFouTSHkF5tOzy8fvyU.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2144,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":130728,\"title\":\"DD Fist of the North Star\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Lv6YKpP12AUalXkBzJb7Mg2sRd.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21333333333333335,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8RG0uTAbrHQZae8BnXiTSA0xDFo.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The World Is Pitch-Black\",\"overview\":\"Leopard is a descendant of Doronjo, who led a group of thieves called Doronbow. After coming to hold a grudge against Yatterman, she calls herself Doronjo and forms a new Doronbow, together with the descendants of Doronjo's underlings.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4PJzBilFCwYrEpZVu5H45R2eWL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"We'll Give Yatterman a Forehead Flicking\",\"overview\":\"After forming a new Doronbow, Doronjo, Boyacky and Tonzra finally enter Yatter Kingdom in order to give a forehead flicking to Yatterman. However, after the fight, they realize something that they had never even thought of.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yTwOnhAjWk4xkvdkR9UBpPx4z80.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-18\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"We're Not Angels But We'll Pretend to Be\",\"overview\":\"After being defeated by Yatter soldiers, Doronjo, Boyacky and Tonzra find a house to hide. There, they meet Alouette, who mistakes them for angels. She thinks that they are there to grant her wish to be reunited with her parents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a43JGtHi8DoNb3ga2LmW81pSELk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Steamy Outdoor Hot Spring Trip\",\"overview\":\"Doronjo and the gang come to know a couple when they stop by a village. When the wife goes to collect firewood, she offers to take them to a hot spring. Then, when they come back, they see her husband being taken away by the Yatter soldiers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4QRQkn6xh24LrK0czhfB1ZU2x3c.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-01\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Hurricane Dedicated to His Mother\",\"overview\":\"Doronjo and her gang visit a town where a snow festival is being held. There, they meet Takeshi, who tells them that he’s going to enter one of the martial arts tournaments. After they find out that there are rewards, Galina ends up entering as well.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6jQAm7nGxR1xxOq586rO8ZQNZ1f.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Flower That Blooms in Winter\",\"overview\":\"General Goro persistently pursues Doronjo and her gang, putting them in constant danger. Out of concern for Doronjo's safety, Boyacky and Tonzra suggest that they temporarily give up on trying to give Yatterman a forehead flicking.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qAscZEAsg4uaImnuJ2N0WDQtFLz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Dream Sea\",\"overview\":\"The gang comes to a seashore where a wall divides the open sea and the inland sea. Due to their hunger, they get woozy and mistake Ryu, a fisherman, for a turtle, and rescue him from Yatter soldiers, hoping that he'll take them to the Sea God’s Palace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/deuQ7iXMDVLMbbHMJ3BpCVVSuZh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Kussie of Lake Kussharo-Dessharo\",\"overview\":\"The gang takes a break from their traveling in order for Doronjo to rest and recover from a cold. While Galina tries to tend to Doronjo, Alouette goes to a river to get some water. There, she meets a creature that was separated from its mother.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57oLwf2sC6G1BqT0P6C95sSYZZh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-01\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Abareshi Prison\",\"overview\":\"After a series of failures, General Goro becomes serious about pursuing Doronjo and her gang. Realizing that this is his last chance to make up for his failures, he sets a trap in a small town, which leads to his success in capturing Doronbow.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wFOcrwKLZydcKoczvGqk17NnUHX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-08\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods' Encirclement\",\"overview\":\"Doronbow finally reaches Yatter Metropolis. When they see people being forced to work for Yatterman, Doronjo renews her vow to bring down Yatterman and they sneak into Yatterman's palace, where they're met by the Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/amMuvGM8Knp7P5lBgjHZ1aDAke5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-15\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Truth About Yatter Metropolis\",\"overview\":\"Doronjo and her gang were taken to see Yatterman although the one who actually greeted them was Dokurobey. Stunned by the situation, they ask him to explain what is going on. There, Dokurobey starts telling his story of how he ended up being there.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lmFcaDeRH5xPcaZbXhx78wAQhhG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-22\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Dawn\",\"overview\":\"After being attacked and falling into a lake, Doronjo and the gang manage to survive. Doronjo comes to realize that in order to change the world, people need to be told the truth about Yatterman; however, no one believes what Doronbow has to say.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kfCOamQyDjrctF0zop1RsIcwCyy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-03-29\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-01-11\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}